# Track .claude/settings.json and .claude/hooks/ so shared config and hook scripts
# are versioned and backed up. Only the machine-local overrides stay ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
# launch.json is written by Claude Code's preview tooling, not by hand — every
# session that starts a dev server appends an entry, so it accreted six stale
# duplicate-port configs in a few days. Machine-local like settings.local.json.
.claude/launch.json

